---
import DashboardLayout from "../components/DashboardLayout.astro";
---

<DashboardLayout
  title="AI awareness"
  description="Are the core products mentioned, recommended, and cited across real model answers?"
  active="ai-awareness"
  view="ai-awareness"
>
  <div slot="meta" class="page-head__meta">
    <span class="state none" data-ai-awareness-state>Loading saved evidence</span>
    <span class="measurement-boundary-note" data-ai-awareness-boundary>Provider-backed Codex and Claude observations</span>
    <span class="snapshot-time" data-outcome-time>Reading provider evidence</span>
  </div>
  <section class="owner-section owner-section--directory" aria-labelledby="ai-awareness-title">
    <div class="section-head">
      <div>
        <h2 id="ai-awareness-title">Core product awareness</h2>
        <p>Model outcomes first. Crawl and referral activity remain supporting discovery evidence.</p>
        <p class="measurement-boundary-note" data-dashboard-coverage="ai-awareness">Reading provider coverage</p>
      </div>
      <span class="count" data-dashboard-count="ai-awareness">—</span>
    </div>
    <div class="loading-state" data-dashboard-slot="ai-awareness">Building AI awareness view…</div>
  </section>
  <section class="owner-section owner-section--directory" aria-labelledby="brand-evidence-title">
    <div class="section-head brand-evidence-head">
      <div>
        <h2 id="brand-evidence-title">Brand evidence</h2>
        <p>Original prompts, answers, citations and community findings for one project, and the follow-ups they led to.</p>
        <p class="measurement-boundary-note">API model checks and consumer-assistant captures are counted separately. A failed provider call stays a failure; it is never counted as a missing mention.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="brand-evidence-controls">
        <label>
          <span class="sr-only">Brand evidence project</span>
          <select data-brand-evidence-project>
            <option value="">Reading profiles</option>
          </select>
        </label>
        <button type="button" class="secondary-action" data-brand-evidence-check disabled>Run API check</button>
        <span class="portfolio-refresh-status" role="status" aria-live="polite" data-brand-evidence-status></span>
      </div>
      <span class="count" data-dashboard-count="brand-evidence">—</span>
    </div>
    <div class="loading-state" data-dashboard-slot="brand-evidence">Reading private brand evidence…</div>
  </section>
  <section class="owner-section owner-section--directory" aria-labelledby="geo-awareness-title">
    <div class="section-head">
      <div>
        <h2 id="geo-awareness-title">GEO Observatory — organic ranking</h2>
        <p>Every configured query classed against the live SERP. <strong>A</strong> = own domain in the top three organic results, <strong>B</strong> = partial page-one visibility, <strong>C</strong> = absent from page one. Class C is a measured absence; a product with no panel is an unmeasured one.</p>
        <p class="measurement-boundary-note" data-dashboard-coverage="geo-awareness">Reading GEO coverage</p>
      </div>
      <span class="count" data-dashboard-count="geo-awareness">—</span>
    </div>
    <div class="loading-state" data-dashboard-slot="geo-awareness">Building GEO ledger…</div>
  </section>
</DashboardLayout>
